    "text": "Let <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>O</mi><mfenced><mn>0,0</mn></mfenced></math> and <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>A</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mn>0,1</mn></mfenced></math>&nbsp;be two fixed points. Then, the locus of a point <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>P</mi></math> such that the perimeter of <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>&#916;</mi><mi>A</mi><mi>O</mi><mi>P</mi></math> is <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>4</mn></math> is",
