  "correctValue": null,
  "solution": {
    "text": "<img src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/pyq/jee_main/bb2039ce-0ea6-40d7-a211-5935b799b467-image.png\" style=\"width: 351px; height: 357px;\" /><br />&nbsp;Given,&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>O</mi><mi>A</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>P</mi><mi>O</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>P</mi><mi>A</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>4</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#160;</mi></math><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>P</mi><mi>O</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>P</mi><mi>A</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>3</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#160;</mi></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo></math>Locus of <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>P</mi></math> is ellipse with foci at <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>O</mi></math>&nbsp;&amp; <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>A</mi></math> and major</p><p>axis <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>b</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>3</mn></math></p><p>Distance between foci <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>b</mi><mi>e</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>e</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>3</mn></mfrac></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo></math>Minor axis&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>2</mn><mi>a</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>b</mi><msqrt><mn>1</mn><mo>-</mo><msup><mi>e</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></msqrt><mo>=</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>.</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>2</mn><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt></mrow><mn>3</mn></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt></math></p><p><math><mo>&#8658;</mo></math> Equation of Locus of <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>P</mi></math>&nbsp;is :</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfrac><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mn>8</mn></mfrac><mo>+</mo><mfrac><msup><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>y</mi><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac></mrow></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup><mn>9</mn></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>4</mn></mfrac></math></p><p>By simplifying&nbsp;the above equation, we get</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>9</mn><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>8</mn><msup><mi>y</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>-</mo><mn>8</mn><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>16</mn></math></p>",
